{"id": "5cfc9f5f-4e5c-4c7a-aa20-9fc0835b3343", "slug": "nexusflow-data-refined-1", "title": "NexusFlow - Data Refined", "description": "Nexusflow Data Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"NexusFlow - Data Refined\"\ndescription: \"Nexusflow Data Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#18181B\"\n  accent: \"#EF4444\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# NexusFlow - Data Refined\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 52; favorites: 13; remixes: 4.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nNexusflow Data Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nNexusFlow Engine Use Cases API Rates Sign In Start Trial 4M+ records normalized today Purify raw data. Instantly. Detect anomalies. Standardize formats. Maximize precision. Processed seamlessly at lightning speed. Launc…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Purify raw data. Instantly..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #18181B, accent #EF4444, background #030303, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NexusFlow - Data Refined</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-white font-sans antialiased relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#10b981]/30\">\n\n    <!-- Background System (z-0) -->\n    <div id=\"v-bar-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 flex items-end justify-center gap-1 opacity-80 pointer-events-none px-4\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Laser (z-0, mix-blend-screen drops black background) -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-laser\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none w-full h-full mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Interactive Background Glows (z-0) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[80vw] max-w-2xl aspect-square bg-[#10b981] blur-2xl opacity-30 rounded-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[60vw] max-w-xl aspect-square bg-[#10b981] blur-2xl opacity-40 rounded-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Foreground Content (z-10) -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto min-h-screen p-4 md:p-12 flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-2xl mb-16 pt-4\">\n            <nav class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 rounded-full shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16,185,129,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                <div class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    NexusFlow\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-100\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Engine</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Use Cases</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">API</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Rates</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium hover:text-white transition-colors hidden sm:block text-emerald-100\">Sign In</a>\n                    <button class=\"bg-white text-[#030303] text-sm font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">\n                        Start Trial\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Hero Content -->\n        <section class=\"relative w-full max-w-4xl px-4 pb-12 flex flex-col items-center text-center flex-shrink-0 z-20\">\n            <!-- Status Label -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-8 text-xs font-mono tracking-tight rounded-full px-4 py-2 shadow-md text-emerald-100\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16,185,129,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#10b981] animate-pulse\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.8);\"></div>\n                4M+ records normalized today\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n            <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.1] mb-6\">\n                Purify raw data. <br> Instantly.\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subheadline -->\n            <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto text-emerald-100\">\n                Detect anomalies. Standardize formats. Maximize precision.<br>\n                Processed seamlessly at lightning speed.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA -->\n            <div>\n                <button class=\"bg-white text-[#030303] text-sm font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] inline-flex items-center gap-2\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">\n                    Launch Workspace\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Visual / Animation Area -->\n        <section class=\"relative flex-grow w-full max-w-4xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden min-h-[400px] mt-8 z-10 rounded-[3rem]\">\n\n            <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-12\">\n\n                <!-- Left Side: Errors -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-1/3 h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-start gap-12 pt-12\">\n\n                    <div class=\"float-item flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-lg\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); transform: rotate(-4deg); margin-left: -2rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,68,68,0.3) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-500/20 text-red-400\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Missing values\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"float-item flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-lg\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); transform: rotate(2deg); margin-left: 2rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,68,68,0.3) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-500/20 text-red-400\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Parsing error\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"float-item flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-lg\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); transform: rotate(-1deg); margin-left: 0rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,68,68,0.3) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-500/20 text-red-400\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Schema mismatch\n                    </div>\n\n                     <div class=\"float-item flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-lg\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); transform: rotate(5deg); margin-left: 1rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,68,68,0.3) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-500/20 text-red-400\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Invalid type\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Side: Cleaned -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-1/2 h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-end gap-8 pt-8\">\n\n                    <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); margin-right: 4rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16,185,129,0.5) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/20 text-[#10b981]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Gaps filled\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); margin-right: 1rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16,185,129,0.5) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/20 text-[#10b981]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Formats aligned\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); margin-right: 6rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16,185,129,0.5) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/20 text-[#10b981]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Entities linked\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); margin-right: -2rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16,185,129,0.5) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/20 text-[#10b981]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Types enforced\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white relative z-20 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\" style=\"backdrop-filter: blur(24px); margin-right: 3rem; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(24,24,27,0.7), rgba(24,24,27,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16,185,129,0.5) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%) border-box;\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/20 text-[#10b981]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        Pipelines synced\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Dynamic V-Bar Background Generation & Animation (Shifted to Emerald Palette)\n            const vContainer = document.getElementById('v-bar-container');\n            const numBars = 35;\n            const middleIdx = Math.floor(numBars / 2);\n            const barsData = [];\n\n            for(let i=0; i<numBars; i++) {\n                const bar = document.createElement('div');\n                const dist = Math.abs(i - middleIdx);\n                const normalizedDist = dist / middleIdx;\n                const baseH = 20 + (normalizedDist * normalizedDist) * 80;\n\n                bar.className = 'flex-1 origin-bottom';\n                bar.style.background = 'linear-gradient(to top, #020617 0%, #064e3b 22%, #ffffff 42%, #10b981 65%, transparent 95%)';\n                bar.style.height = `${baseH}vh`;\n                bar.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease';\n\n                vContainer.appendChild(bar);\n                barsData.push({ el: bar, index: i });\n            }\n\n            let time = 0;\n            function animateV() {\n                time += 0.05;\n                barsData.forEach(b => {\n                    const wave = Math.sin(time + b.index * 0.3) * 0.15;\n                    const scaleY = 1 + wave;\n                    const opacity = 0.4 + Math.sin(time * 0.8 + b.index * 0.1) * 0.3;\n                    b.el.style.transform = `scaleY(${scaleY})`;\n                    b.el.style.opacity = opacity;\n                });\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateV);\n            }\n            animateV();\n\n            // 2. WebGL Laser Setup\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-laser');\n            const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl');\n\n            if (gl) {\n                const vsSource = `\n                    attribute vec2 position;\n                    void main() {\n                        gl_Position = vec4(position, 0.0, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `;\n\n                const fsSource = `\n                    precision highp float;\n                    uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                    uniform float u_time;\n\n                    // Pseudo-random hashing\n                    float hash(vec2 p) {\n                        return fract(sin(dot(p, vec2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453);\n                    }\n\n                    // Value noise\n                    float noise(vec2 p) {\n                        vec2 i = floor(p);\n                        vec2 f = fract(p);\n                        f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n                        float a = hash(i);\n                        float b = hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0));\n                        float c = hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0));\n                        float d = hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0));\n                        return mix(mix(a, b, f.x), mix(c, d, f.x), f.y);\n                    }\n\n                    // Fractional Brownian Motion (FBM)\n                    float fbm(vec2 p) {\n                        float f = 0.0;\n                        float amp = 0.5;\n                        for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n                            f += amp * noise(p);\n                            p *= 2.0;\n                            amp *= 0.5;\n                        }\n                        return f;\n                    }\n\n                    void main() {\n                        // Normalize UV coordinates centered\n                        vec2 uv = (gl_FragCoord.xy - 0.5 * u_resolution.xy) / min(u_resolution.x, u_resolution.y);\n\n                        // Base Emerald color #10b981\n                        vec3 brandColor = vec3(0.063, 0.725, 0.506);\n\n                        float dist = abs(uv.x);\n                        float pulse = sin(u_time * 2.0) * 0.1 + 0.9;\n\n                        // 1. Crisp white-hot inner core\n                        float core = 0.0003 / (dist + 0.0001);\n                        vec3 coreColor = vec3(1.0) * core;\n\n                        // 2. Restrained colored halo\n                        float halo = 0.002 / (dist + 0.001) * pulse;\n                        vec3 haloColor = brandColor * halo;\n\n                        // 3. Soft smoky fog drifting around the beam\n                        vec2 noiseUV = vec2(uv.x * 3.0, uv.y * 2.0 - u_time * 0.3);\n                        float n = fbm(noiseUV);\n\n                        // Falloff so smoke only exists near the beam\n                        float smokeAlpha = exp(-dist * 12.0);\n                        float smoke = n * smokeAlpha * 0.7 * pulse;\n                        vec3 smokeColor = brandColor * smoke;\n\n                        // Combine elements\n                        vec3 finalColor = coreColor + haloColor + smokeColor;\n\n                        // Mild atmospheric bleed in center\n                        finalColor += brandColor * 0.05 * exp(-dist * 4.0);\n\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0); // mix-blend-screen drops the black background naturally\n                    }\n                `;\n\n                const vs = gl.createShader(gl.VERTEX_SHADER);\n                gl.shaderSource(vs, vsSource);\n                gl.compileShader(vs);\n\n                const fs = gl.createShader(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER);\n                gl.shaderSource(fs, fsSource);\n                gl.compileShader(fs);\n\n                const program = gl.createProgram();\n                gl.attachShader(program, vs);\n                gl.attachShader(program, fs);\n                gl.linkProgram(program);\n                gl.useProgram(program);\n\n                const vertices = new Float32Array([\n                    -1, -1,\n                     1, -1,\n                    -1,  1,\n                     1,  1,\n                ]);\n\n                const buffer = gl.createBuffer();\n                gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buffer);\n                gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, vertices, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n                const pos = gl.getAttribLocation(program, 'position');\n                gl.enableVertexAttribArray(pos);\n                gl.vertexAttribPointer(pos, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n                const uRes = gl.getUniformLocation(program, 'u_resolution');\n                const uTime = gl.getUniformLocation(program, 'u_time');\n\n                function resize() {\n                    canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                    canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n                    gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n                    gl.uniform2f(uRes, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n                }\n\n                window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n                resize();\n\n                let startTime = performance.now();\n                function renderWebGL(now) {\n                    gl.uniform1f(uTime, (now - startTime) / 1000);\n                    gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n                    requestAnimationFrame(renderWebGL);\n                }\n                renderWebGL(performance.now());\n            }\n\n            // 3. Masked Word Reveal Animation for Hero Title\n            const title = document.getElementById('hero-title');\n            const text = title.innerHTML;\n\n            function splitTextToWords(element) {\n                element.innerHTML = text.replace(/Purify raw data\\.|Instantly\\./g, match => {\n                     return match.split(' ').map(word => `<span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-2\"><span class=\"inline-block word-span transform translate-y-[120%] opacity-0\" style=\"will-change: transform, opacity;\">${word}</span></span>`).join(' ');\n                });\n            }\n\n            splitTextToWords(title);\n\n            gsap.to(\".word-span\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // 4. Floating Animation for Glass Pill Tags\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.float-item').forEach((item, i) => {\n                gsap.to(item, {\n                    y: \"-=15\",\n                    rotation: \"+=1\",\n                    duration: 2 + Math.random(),\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    delay: Math.random() * 2\n                });\n            });\n\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.float-item-alt').forEach((item, i) => {\n                gsap.to(item, {\n                    y: \"+=10\",\n                    x: \"+=5\",\n                    duration: 2.5 + Math.random(),\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    delay: Math.random() * 2\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "nexusflow-data-refined-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexusflow-data-refined-1.jpg", "source_name": "nexusflow-data-refined-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 270, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:56:32.10039+00:00"}